    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I get the summary, but it feels like you're just giving me the textbook definitions. Can you be more specific? Like, when people talk about \"inherent physiological differences,\" are we talking about actual performance gaps that make competition impossible, or is that just a talking point? I'm trying to see if one side's argument is actually more grounded in science than the other.",
